Mon Oct  5 02:36:28 UTC 2026 - Lucas G. Bueno <lucasgbueno@proton.me>

- Package snapshot 7c93c7bbfa7a78a64e93c464e1f854c7147ced45 from main.
  It shows the current frame again when the server presents a replaced
  buffer late. That left old pixels on screen after a root resize, and
  made the X11 test of it fail in about one build in three.
- Document installation from these repositories in the README.

