Mon Oct  5 00:59:40 UTC 2026 - Lucas G. Bueno <lucasgbueno@proton.me>

- Add a Debian source package beside the RPM recipe. Built on Debian 13
  with Rust from backports, its .deb also installs on Ubuntu and Linux
  Mint, because the binary needs only glibc 2.34.
- Name the two source archives as Debian orig archives and compress the
  dependency archive with xz, so the recipe and the .dsc share them;
  dpkg-source does not read zstd. The archive contents are unchanged.

