Sun Oct  4 23:56:15 UTC 2026 - Lucas G. Bueno <lucasgbueno@proton.me>

- Build on Fedora as well, with its cargo-rpm-macros and package names
  beside the openSUSE ones. The same sources, tests and checks apply.
- Link identical dependency notices with fdupes instead of shipping
  every copy, which rpmlint reported as files-duplicated-waste.

